            <div xml:id="d771">

                <pb facs="1049" n="929" xml:id="pg929"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2806: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Warren</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-09T13:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 9,
                                1922—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 9—3:30
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>190. Your 134, November 7, 5 p.m. Uchida informed me today the Japanese
                    Government has no objection to delay pending Stevens’ arrival Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Warren</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
